  "limits": "Forward search over Dictionary world states; facts are compared with ==. The heuristic counts unmet goal facts, so the plan is the cheapest only when every action costs at least 1 and sets at most one goal fact. Large action sets need the max_nodes bound. Verified with Godot 4.7.2 headless; written against the Godot 4.3 API.",
